    "shortDescription" : "Graph-based clustering using scikit-learn SpectralClustering (eigenvectors + k-means).",
    "longDescription" : "This tool runs SpectralClustering from scikit-learn. It constructs an affinity matrix (e.g., RBF or a k-NN graph), computes a spectral embedding (eigenvectors of the graph Laplacian), and then clusters in the embedding space (typically via k-means). Outputs: cluster labels per sample, optionally the spectral embedding, and an HTML report with parameters and statistics.",
